                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "account_id",
                  "description": "(Required) The account ID of the business unit. This corresponds to hub ID in the Data Management API. To convert a hub ID into an account ID you need to remove the “b.” prefix. For example, a hub ID of b.c8b0c73d-3ae9 translates to an account ID of c8b0c73d-3ae9."
